&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strategies. Shape change. Lead enterprise data transformation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary &lt;strong&gt;Data Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory Leader&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;Managing Principal&lt;/strong&gt; level to shape the future of data in financial services. You will lead the design, delivery, and scaling of enterprise-wide data strategies for tier-one banks, insurers, and investment firms — helping them unlock the value of their data and meet the demands of an ever-evolving regulatory and digital landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not just about advising — it’s about &lt;strong&gt;owning the transformation agenda&lt;/strong&gt;: defining innovative propositions, leading complex consulting engagements, inspiring cross-disciplinary teams, and driving commercial growth. You’ll be at the forefront of modern data strategy, governance, analytics, and AI adoption, while mentoring the next generation of data leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and operationalise enterprise data strategies&lt;/strong&gt; that enable business transformation across banking, insurance, and investment sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead high-impact consulting engagements&lt;/strong&gt; in data governance, literacy, quality, regulatory response, and analytics-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape new market propositions&lt;/strong&gt; in data consulting, including the adoption of AI, advanced analytics, and cloud-based data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive process modernisation&lt;/strong&gt; — from business analysis to technical design, solution implementation, and long-term optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted&lt;strong&gt; senior stakeholder relationships&lt;/strong&gt;, influencing strategic decisions and securing follow-on mandates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale data capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; across internal teams and client organisations, ensuring consistent, high-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;thought leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, industry events, and internal innovation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of senior-level consulting experience in financial services, with a strong data strategy and advisory focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise across the &lt;strong&gt;full data lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;, supported by frameworks such as DAMA DMBOK, DCAM, or CDMC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;enterprise data transformation&lt;/strong&gt; and practical experience in implementing &lt;strong&gt;modern data management solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;business development&lt;/strong&gt; — from proposition design to pipeline growth and client relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on involvement in &lt;strong&gt;agile consulting projects&lt;/strong&gt;, and the ability to navigate complex analytical challenges with ease.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and &lt;strong&gt;influencing skills&lt;/strong&gt; across senior business and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in German&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;data regulations&lt;/strong&gt; such as BCBS 239, CCAR, Solvency II.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;SQL, Python&lt;/strong&gt;, and related data analytics methods and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying &lt;strong&gt;AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; in financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal certifications in &lt;strong&gt;data governance, architecture, or strategy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in leading large, multi-disciplinary delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact, &lt;strong&gt;transformational data strategies&lt;/strong&gt; for leading financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a &lt;strong&gt;collaborative, entrepreneurial culture&lt;/strong&gt; where your ideas shape the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access &lt;strong&gt;continuous learning&lt;/strong&gt;, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence not only client outcomes but also the &lt;strong&gt;strategic direction&lt;/strong&gt; of our data practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a team that’s redefining the &lt;strong&gt;future of digital financial services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capco’s &lt;strong&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork culture&lt;/strong&gt; means we celebrate individuality and work in an environment where diverse perspectives truly drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to &lt;strong&gt;lead transformation, challenge the status quo, and leave a lasting impact&lt;/strong&gt; on the financial services data landscape, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Specialist, you are responsible for the structure, quality, and continuous development of our technical detail database. You ensure that technical solutions are standardized, documented, and usable for digital planning and automation processes, as well as for assembly, production, and tendering activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this forward-looking role, you work at the intersection of building system development, digitalization, and industrialized construction. Against the backdrop of ongoing production and construction projects, you contribute to systematically capturing and integrating lessons learned, supporting the continuous improvement of our product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, manage, and further develop the central technical detail database.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, structure, and quality-assure technical details and construction drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and continuously improve drawing and documentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency, traceability, and version control within detail libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and integrate requirements from automation processes into detail standards and data structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze recurring quality deviations and translate findings into standardized details, drawing standards, and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the implementation of agreed improvement measures within relevant drawing and documentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completed vocational training or a degree in Architecture, Civil Engineering, Construction Technology, Technical Drafting, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the technical planning and detailed design of building constructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in AutoCAD 2D.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to document technical information clearly and apply standards consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and enjoyment of collaborating with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and English skills, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in the areas listed below is considered an advantage. We do not expect candidates to meet every requirement but welcome applicants with a broad range of relevant skills and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with dynamic blocks, block libraries, and attribute programming in AutoCAD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of layer, block, and drawing standards, as well as XREF structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AutoCAD automation solutions, such as AutoLISP, VBA, or comparable technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data extraction and further processing of drawing data, particularly using Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;unlimited&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;contract &lt;/strong&gt;with 30 vacation days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Flexible work:&lt;/strong&gt; We value regular in‑person collaboration in the office, while also offering working from home and the opportunity to work up to 40 days a year from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Attractive perks and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We offer a company pension scheme, language courses (English/German), and employee discounts with selected sustainable brands. Furthermore, our external partners in mental health support you in strengthening your mental health through anonymous private/group sessions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Virtual Shares Program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Participate in the success of GROPYUS through our Virtual Share Program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: You can truly make your mark with your work and contributions – on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; all our organizational levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The chance to be part of something big&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Our mission is to rethink an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and fostering sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A diverse and enriching work environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Become a valued member of a wonderfully diverse team of individuals from over 50 countries. At GROPYUS we value inclusion above all, ensuring that everyone feels they belong – no matter their background. In this way, our differences become strengths that help us grow as a team.&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Localization team builds and owns the systems that make sure every merchant, in every one of our 38 markets, can understand and use our products in their own language. It&#39;s one of the most critical enablers of SumUp&#39;s global growth, sitting at the heart of how fast and how well we can go to market anywhere in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As our Senior Full Stack Engineer, you&#39;ll bring dedicated engineering ownership by working closely with the team to scope, build and ship the systems, integrations and tooling accelerate the ongoing evolution of our localization platform towards greater automation, scalability and end-to-end integration. If you want autonomy, meaningful scope, and the chance to shape a growing function, this is the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Design, build and optimise localization solutions across product, CMS, CRM, marketing and design systems, so content moves faster without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Improve the localization management platform to give the team greater visibility and control while reducing manual steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Embed automated language and quality checks into several steps of the localization workflows, catching issues before they reach production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Improve the experience for developers, designers, marketers and content teams by ensuring localization solutions support their processes and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner with Web and Mobile, Website, Comms Platform and other technical teams to enable localization capabilities across the technology stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Explore how AI and language technology can strengthen and future-proof the localization stack, while ensuring solutions meet evolving compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong background in backend engineering, ideally with Go (alternatively knowledge with Python, Rust or C++)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience building and maintaining RESTful APIs in a microservices or distributed systems environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of databases such as PostgreSQL and event streaming tools such as Kafka&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Comfort translating priorities from non technical stakeholders into scoped, shippable engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ability to operate independently across a fragmented, distributed system landscape, working within architecture owned by other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Exposure to frontend frameworks such as Reactjs and languages like Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience working with translation management systems (TMS), or with the localization of web or mobile applications and other content platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🎁 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;Berlin office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Performance Marketing Working Student – Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Working student, 20 hours/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a look at where you&#39;ll be based: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;watch the Berlin office tour&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition&#39;s Performance Marketing function helps attract the right candidates efficiently across different markets and roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to strengthen our in-house capabilities, you&#39;ll support day-to-day campaign operations, reporting and continuous improvement. You&#39;ll work closely with teams across Talent Acquisition and Employer branding, gaining hands-on experience in how data, digital marketing and operational processes support hiring at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day monitoring of paid recruitment marketing campaigns and flag anything that needs attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep job listings live, accurate and correctly categorised across active boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly performance reporting across impressions, clicks, applications, cost per application and candidate pipeline contribution, and flag unusual performance or budget pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate creative feedback between the TA team, Employer Brand and external agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research markets, audiences and competitors to help sharpen the marketing approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve recurring workflows and identify opportunities to make processes more efficient and support recurring operational tasks across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying Marketing, Digital Marketing, Communications, Media, Business, Data Analytics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on exposure to marketing, recruitment, creative content or communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with spreadsheets and interpreting basic campaign metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re detail-oriented, organised and comfortable taking ownership of recurring tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in digital marketing, data and how processes can be improved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office at Ostbahnhof&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Be part of an inclusive and collaborative environment where different perspectives are valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days, pro-rated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Access health and well-being support through our Employee Assistance Programme, an Urban Sports Club subsidy, and fitness activities, including on-site gym access, yoga sessions, and team sports&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚆 Benefit from subsidised public transport with the Deutschlandticket, offering unlimited travel on local and regional transport across Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗 Enjoy partially subsidised office lunches and weekly breakfast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Receive additional rewards through our employee referral programme when referring talents to join our team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
