&lt;p&gt;Do you love dissecting code to understand how it really works, and want to build tools that help millions of other developers trust theirs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build Qodana to bring the intelligence of JetBrains IDEs directly into the CI/CD pipeline, helping engineering teams spot security flaws, license issues, and bugs before they ever reach production. As AI-assisted coding grows, the need for deep, static code analysis is more critical than ever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll join our Qodana Core team to expand our static analysis engine and design new algorithms for complex, inter-procedural code analysis. You will have direct ownership over how we configure and orchestrate these analyses across different environments. You’ll collaborate closely with other JetBrains compiler and IDE teams, directly influencing how development teams worldwide maintain code quality and adopt AI safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement new static analysis checks, rules, and inter-procedural analysis algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend Qodana’s capabilities in critical areas like license compliance, security, and vulnerability detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize how code analysis runs, configure execution paths, and orchestrate performance based on project context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine CI/CD integrations to make Qodana easy to adopt across different development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with compiler and IDE teams across JetBrains to share insights and align analysis engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of features from early concept to release, gathering feedback and iterating to make them better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep curiosity about code structure, compilers, and how static analysis works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset, not waiting for permission to fix a broken process or improve a system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and a readiness to support your technical ideas with clear, logical reasoning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a distributed team across different countries and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focus on quality over quick fixes, valuing long-term maintainability in your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer tooling, static analysis, application security, or LLM-based applications would be a plus. Familiarity with languages and ecosystems beyond the JVM – such as C++, Rust, JavaScript or TypeScript, Python, .NET, or Go – would also be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, practical knowledge of JVM development (such as Kotlin or Java).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing complex algorithms or handling performance-critical backend architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent communication skills in English to collaborate with team members globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 3 months:&lt;/strong&gt; You will get familiar with the Qodana codebase and the IntelliJ Platform architecture, delivering your first set of analysis rules and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6 months:&lt;/strong&gt; You will take full ownership of specific analysis features, collaborating with neighboring teams to design robust solutions for complex codebases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long term:&lt;/strong&gt; You will help shape the technical direction of Qodana Core, continuously raising the bar for static analysis performance and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary – We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule – Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off – More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities – Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support – Assistance to help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free meals and snacks – Lunch and refreshments provided to keep you fueled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness – On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events – Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;If you want to build and own the systems that decide what JetBrains customers are entitled to use and bill them accurately for it, this is for you. You will focus on designing backend services, keeping complex commercial flows correct, and tackling hard distributed systems challenges on the critical path of every paid request.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, the Cloud Platform department builds the underlying infrastructure that powers authentication, paid capabilities, usage metering, and accounting. Within this department, the Licensing &amp;amp; Billing team sits right at the center of our commercial model, turning what a customer buys into what they are actually allowed to use, and accounting for that consumption accurately enough to bill on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The complexity of our entitlement, quota, and metering systems continues to grow. In this role, you will own the correctness and evolution of these backend services, take full ownership of end-to-end data flows, tackle distributed consistency across unreliable upstream systems, and ensure revenue-affecting data migrations happen cleanly without taking services offline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate backend services that decide what a customer is entitled to and what their usage costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own flows end to end, from ingesting licensing and purchase data from upstream systems to enforcing quotas and recording consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve our domain model to handle new commercial structures, combining seat-based plans and usage-based models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design integrations with external systems, ensuring correctness through idempotency, ordering, reconciliation, and eventual consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute live data migrations using feature flags, dual writes, backfills, and verification at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build observability into our systems by defining invariants, metrics, and alerts to catch silent divergence before customers do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design internal APIs with explicit focus on versioning, backward compatibility, and developer experience for other JetBrains teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system performance and reliability under continuous production load while decommissioning legacy subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write integration tests against real dependencies and maintain reliable test infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate production incidents, find root causes, and follow through on lasting fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineer’s dedication to accuracy, especially in domains where system errors have direct financial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic judgment when designing distributed systems where correctness under unreliable delivery is the main constraint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A habit of trusting metrics, traces, and logs to understand production behavior rather than relying on assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating and simplifying large existing codebases containing legacy decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, direct communication skills to agree on API contracts across teams with different priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focus on testing as an essential design tool rather than an afterthought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building and operating backend services on the JVM platform using Kotlin or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid working knowledge of relational databases, including transactions, isolation levels, locking, indexing, and live schema migrations (PostgreSQL preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of distributed systems patterns, such as idempotency, retry strategies, eventual consistency, and data reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience making live data migrations or system changes without downtime using feature flags and staged rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing versioned, backward-compatible APIs for other engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with event-driven architectures and message brokers like Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to diagnose, debug, and resolve production incidents in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in both written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means building a bulletproof entitlement and metering foundation that product teams can trust without hesitation. You will have successfully migrated live commercial systems to support new billing models without downtime or data divergence. Silent errors will be caught automatically by system invariants before affecting users, and internal teams will integrate seamlessly with your clean, versioned APIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible. (keep if relevant for the role)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KT1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Menu Planning working student for 12 months at the heart of our Product team, where you will be responsible for supporting our operational and strategic needs for our physical product: meal kits. You will be central to our activity and will have a significant influence on our customers&#39; meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone capable of assisting us in the operational planning of recipes at HelloFresh. This is a unique opportunity to learn and gain experience within a fast-growing company that is pioneering the food industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to be a driving force in the growth of a scale-up, then this position is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menu creation and optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Assist the team in creating and optimizing menus using our python-based menu-planning algorithm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work on several projects and initiatives that focus on improving our product offering aiming to increase customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menu De-Risking:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead a number of cross-collaborative initiatives and processes aiming to reduce the menu risk and to ensure ingredient availability by considering the end-to-end value chain of our product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations support:&lt;/strong&gt; You support the team in day-to-day operations as well as with administrative and organizational tasks along the supply and menu planning process and have the opportunity to solve concrete problems, make decisions, and learn to manage real-world situations in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process management:&lt;/strong&gt; You will participate in projects aimed at optimizing and automating and improving our product processes and supply chain by working with other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; You will track the weekly performance of menus and recipes, and conduct analyses on their monthly/quarterly performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipe change management in menus:&lt;/strong&gt; You will select alternative recipes when needed (ingredient shortage, marketing need, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipe &amp;amp; Ingredient Pool management:&lt;/strong&gt; You will contribute to the maintenance of the recipe and ingredient database in alignment with the culinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customization: &lt;/strong&gt;You will support the expansion of our product offering by uploading and managing customized menu options to provide customers with greater choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are completing a degree in Business Administration, Management, Industrial Engineering, or a related discipline, ideally with a focus on Product Management, Supply Chain or Operations Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial experience in product management or supply planning, CPG and E-Commerce experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent command of Excel; knowledge of SQL and Python is a real plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on mindset and team spirit, which is very important as you will be working with many different people and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, rigor, and great attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive and ambitious mindset, with a desire to be part of a particularly dynamic business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for the world of food and an interest in data are real assets for this job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern and comfortable working space&lt;/strong&gt; with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discount&lt;/strong&gt; for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; and Buddy Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social events&lt;/strong&gt; including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discounted fitness offers&lt;/strong&gt; with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners, as well as yoga classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monthly allowance for the Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Global Customer Experience (GCX), our mission is to advance the HelloFresh customer relationship from reactive resolution to proactive, trust-building service. The compensation function sits at the heart of that mission: it is the mechanism through which the business acknowledges failures, restores customer confidence, and, when done well, turns a bad experience into a reason to stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director, Customer Compensation &amp;amp; Policy is responsible for the global strategy, architecture, and governance of how HelloFresh compensates customers across all markets and brands. This is not a policy maintenance role. It is a strategic function that sits at the intersection of customer economics, operational data, behavioral experimentation, and cross-functional influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own one of the most financially material and customer-sensitive levers in the business. You will shape a multi-year roadmap and hold peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market Leadership accountable for the quality of inputs that determine how well and how efficiently we recover customer trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The ideal candidate brings a rare combination: analytical rigor sharp enough to architect a global compensation engine from first principles, and the executive presence to drive adoption across a complex, multi-market organization without formal authority over most of the people they need to move.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Global Compensation Strategy &amp;amp; Engine Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategic vision for how HelloFresh categorizes customer errors and determines compensation across all markets, brands, and contact channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and continuous evolution of the compensation engine: along with Tech, you’ll define the the rules, thresholds, segmentation logic, and automation frameworks that govern recovery decisions at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the principles that govern trade-offs between customer generosity and cost discipline and translate those principles into operational rules that hold across market complexity and brand variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology to ensure the compensation engine is scalable, auditable, and capable of supporting dynamic, AI-assisted decisioning as the product evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Behavioral Economics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the global roadmap for compensation experimentation: A/B testing across offer types, value levels, channel timing, and segmentation variables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply behavioral economics frameworks to compensation design understanding how recovery offers shape long-term retention, repurchase behavior, and brand perception, not just immediate satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the measurement framework for experimentation: what constitutes a successful test, what confidence warrants global rollout, and how results are synthesized into durable policy change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics &amp;amp; Insights to ensure test design, sample integrity, and rollout analysis meet a rigorous standard of evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Stewardship &amp;amp; Cost Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global compensation P&amp;amp;L line: tracking spend by market, error category, customer segment, and channel — and holding yourself accountable to defined cost-per-incident and avoidable-contact targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close financial leakage: cases where compensation is being issued without policy justification, at incorrect values, or at the wrong frequency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reporting infrastructure that makes compensation economics visible to GCX leadership, market GMs, and Finance — with the granularity and context needed to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the right balance between cost optimization and customer lifetime value investment: not just &#39;spend less&#39; but &#39;spend where it earns back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Policy &amp;amp; Global Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global fraud and abuse prevention framework: the policies, detection logic, thresholds, and escalation paths that protect the business without creating friction for genuine customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the governance rhythm for policy: quarterly reviews, market exception management, escalation adjudication, and framework versioning across a multi-brand, multi-market environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final authority on complex, cross-market policy gaps — resolving ambiguity with speed, consistency, and strategic clarity rather than routing decisions upward by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain global standards while creating principled space for market-level adaptation where local context genuinely requires it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the compensation function in senior forums translating customer economics into requirements that peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market GMs must respond to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold cross-functional partners accountable for the upstream data quality, operational accuracy, and system reliability that the compensation engine depends on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of policy changes across markets and brands, building communication and change management plans that make new frameworks land — not just launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence at VP and Director level across multiple functions; escalate only strategic blockers, not routine alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or equivalent postgraduate qualification required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in Economics, Business, Engineering, or a quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12 years of progressive experience in customer strategy, pricing, operations, or a directly adjacent domain with meaningful exposure to global, multi-market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of owning a financially significant operational lever and managing it with both analytical precision and strategic judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading and developing teams; comfort operating as a senior individual contributor and a people leader simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in subscription commerce, logistics, or consumer-facing operations strongly preferred. Familiarity with the economics of customer recovery in high-volume, low-margin environments is a distinct advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data analysis; able to build and pressure-test the analytical models that underpin policy decisions without delegating the logic to others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with experimentation methodology: test design, statistical significance, holdout analysis, and the translation of results into policy not just reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or alongside engineering teams to define product and system requirements for rules-based or AI-assisted decisioning tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with financial modeling: building the business case for compensation investment, forecasting spend impact, and tracking actuals against plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior executive presence: able to walk into a GM, COO, or CFO conversation with a clear point of view, defend it under pressure, and leave with alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A credible voice with peers and upward stakeholders not because of title, but because of the quality of analysis and clarity of communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and decisive under ambiguity: able to make a defensible call with incomplete information and adjust as evidence develops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely collaborative across markets and functions able to hold people to standards without damaging the relationships needed to sustain them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The US Payments &amp;amp; Partner Operations (PPO) team owns the core money-movement stack for the Raisin US’ platform: ACH payment initiation, reconciliation, returns, and cut-off scheduling, plus the customer accounts lifecycle — bank linking, fraud signal integration, and identity verification. Beyond payments, the team manages the B2B layer: onboarding and configuring Deposit-taking Banks, service banks, and custodians, including their user/role management. It also covers invoicing data pipelines for Deposit taking banks, escheatment workflows for dormant accounts and visibility for operations and customer support through our internal platform portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver features and bug fixes end-to-end with minimal guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address bottlenecks in the team&#39;s delivery flow, from design to deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI tools intensively for increasing our ability and pace to deliver software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote best practices around our core stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transfer knowledge proactively, lead by example in learning and mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving how we program, test, review, and ship code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag process gaps and propose pragmatic improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate engineers in growing their technical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide constructive code review and solve complex problems together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly build practical depth in PPO&#39;s domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to new feature design and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring engineering perspective into domain discussions alongside other team roles like Product Manager, Tech Lead and Engineering Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a versatile Senior Full-Stack Engineer with a deep, rock-solid foundation in the .NET and SQL Server ecosystem, who has the architectural maturity to adapt to other layers and the drive to learn the rest of our stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Required&lt;/em&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, optimizing, and maintaining robust enterprise APIs using .NET Web API.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and structuring web applications with .Net&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relational database design, complex querying, and performance tuning in SQL Server.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Patterns: A deep understanding of SOLID principles and a proven track record of writing Clean Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structural Strategy: Practical experience working within modern architectural patterns, specifically Clean / Onion Architecture, to keep codebases decoupled and testable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast Learner: You don&#39;t mind stepping out of your .NET comfort zone to touch a React component or a Go microservice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Solver: Highly analytical with a strong focus on detail and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborator: A team-first peer who thrives on open communication and cross-layer collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Desired&lt;/em&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building user interfaces with React JS, JavaScript, and HTML, accompanied by testing tools like Jest or React Testing Library.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to, or curiosity about environments like Node.js, GoLang, or Java / Spring Boot, and building APIs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GraphQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge or conceptual familiarity with MongoDB or NoSQL Databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NUnit for automated testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with secure authentication via OAuth and ASP.NET Identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Partnerships Management&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;team, the group responsible for some of Raisin’s most important strategic relationships. In this role, you’ll work directly with senior stakeholders at banks, helping them succeed on our platform and shaping long-term collaboration.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;In addition, you will contribute to key projects - from launching new savings products on the marketplace to supporting technical bank migrations and much more. Because our impact and stakeholder network are broad, we maintain a unique view of priorities and upcoming changes. Colleagues across the business rely on our team to communicate these changes clearly and explain their impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and grow partnerships:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Build strong, day-to-day relationships with our partner banks, ensuring smooth collaboration and shared success - enabled by in-person meetings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand and enable:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop a deep understanding of each banks’ requirements and align them with Raisin’s platform, working closely with our marketing and distribution teams to and out bank partners to unlock growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive impact across projects:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to special initiatives — from launching new savings products to supporting strategic rollouts — and play an active role in shaping how we deliver value.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate globally:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work with colleagues across different markets and teams on key projects, bringing structure and clarity to complex challenges.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create transparency:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Track and report on partnership progress and project outcomes, ensuring internal stakeholders are aligned and informed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure operational excellence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Keep product information and documentation accurate and up to date, making sure our systems run seamlessly.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;4+ years of experience in consulting, banking, or financial services, with a proven ability to manage senior stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent English and German communication skills, with the ability to influence at executive level.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong academic background in business, finance, economics, or similar.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Structured problem-solving and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-expectation environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A growth mindset and willingness to be hands-on where needed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Marketing teams are stuck between fragmented customer data and martech stacks that copy that data into proprietary silos while customers expect real-time, personalized experiences. Customer Lake, the agentic Customer Data Platform (CDP) built natively into Databricks, changes that equation. It unifies first- and third-party data into governed Customer 360 profiles, resolves identities, and uses agents to build audiences, recommend next-best actions, and activate campaigns across channels, all without copying data out of the Lakehouse or adding vendor lock-in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Architect (Customer Lake) team is part of a dedicated, global go-to-market organization focused on driving adoption and revenue growth for Customer Lake, Databricks’ agentic Customer Data Platform (CDP) built natively into the Data Intelligence Platform. The Customer Lake SA will engage clients across business units and verticals, build relationships with marketing and data stakeholders, position Customer Lake in depth, and deliver presentations, demos, and POCs that drive informed adoption decisions. They will understand the guardrails and the steps needed to successfully land and expand Customer Lake as clients deliver on their customer engagement and growth objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership to guide strategic customers to successful implementations on customer data and marketing projects, ranging from architectural design to data engineering to identity resolution, audience activation, and agent deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with GTM leadership and account teams to design and execute high-impact engagement strategies across your territory, driving Customer Lake adoption from initial Customer 360 build-out through full CDP augmentation or replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a trusted advisor, serve as an expert Solutions Architect building technical credibility with CMOs, heads of marketing technology (MarTech), data engineering leaders, and marketing and analytics teams to drive product adoption and vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable clients at scale through workshops, POC execution, and developing customer-facing collateral that increases technical knowledge and demonstrates the value of an embedded, agentic CDP architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product roadmap by translating field-derived, data-driven insights into strategic recommendations for Product and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle the most complex technical challenges in this product line by acting as the tier-3 escalation point for the field, ensuring customer success in mission-critical, customer-facing data environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and refine the sales qualification and POC intake process, ensuring well-scoped engagements that maximize customer success and minimize friction for R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of customer data platform (CDP), marketing technology (MarTech), or customer data engineering expertise, with a proven track record of designing and delivering client-facing customer data and activation solutions (of which 3+ years are in a customer-facing, pre-sales or consulting role).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design and implementation of data and AI applications for marketing and customer engagement, including identity resolution, segmentation, personalization and next-best-action, and agentic AI workflows for audience building and campaign activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with CDP and martech/adtech platforms, including composable-CDP architectures (Salesforce Data Cloud, Adobe, Segment, Treasure Data, Braze, or similar), including implementation, identity resolution, audience activation, and migration strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the customer data landscape: first-party data (web, app, CRM, POS), third-party and enrichment data, identity graphs, consent and privacy signals, and martech/adtech destinations (ad platforms, email/SMS, CRM, and analytics tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operationalizing customer data as governed data products, including audience and segment definition in SQL or natural language (Genie), reverse-ETL and activation pipelines, and metric, identity, and consent governance in Unity Catalog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Global System Integrators (GSIs) and third-party consulting organizations to drive customer outcomes in marketing and customer data initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building solutions within major public cloud environments (AWS, Azure, or GCP), with an understanding of cloud-native data ingestion, activation, and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree (or higher) in a technical field such as Computer Science, Data Science, Applied Mathematics, Engineering or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director/Teamlead Digital Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Mensch)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;im Bereich Digital führst du ein Team von Digital Media Plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot;&gt;ern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179605223 BCX8&quot;&gt;und entwickelst gemeinsam mit ihnen innovative Kampagnen für renommierte Kunden. Du übernimmst dabei sowohl strategische Verantwortung als auch die fachliche und organisatorische Führung deines Teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mediaplanung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du bist für die Übersetzung übergreifender Strategien in gezielte Mediamaßnahmen sowie für die Qualitätssicherung von Mediaplänen über alle digitalen Kanäle hinweg (u. a. Display, Video, Mobile, Social, Search) verantwortlich.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamführung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du führst fachlich und organisatorisch und kümmerst dich um die Weiterentwicklung deines Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projekte:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du trägst die Verantwortung für die Koordination komplexer, digitaler Projekte in enger Zusammenarbeit mit Kundenteams, Kreativagenturen, Vermarktern und internen Spezialabteilungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marktscreening:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du nimmst eine kontinuierliche&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Marktbeobachtung vor und leitest neue Potenziale für Wachstum und Innovation ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du übernimmst Ergebnisverantwortung für Reportings, Analysen und Präsentationen für internen Stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du bringst mehrjährige Berufserfahrung in der digitalen Mediaplanung, -beratung oder im Kampagnen-Management mit, idealerweise mit erster Führungserfahrung.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifikation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du hast ein abgeschlossenes Studium im Bereich Wirtschafts-, Kommunikations- oder Medienwissenschaften oder vergleichbare Ausbildung in der Medien- oder Werbebranche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du verfügst über fundierte Kenntnisse der gängigen Planungstools und digitalen Kanäle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysefähigkeit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du hast ausgeprägte analytische Fähigkeiten sowie eine strukturierte, lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Überzeugungskraft:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du überzeugst mit starker Kundenorientierung, Durchsetzungsvermögen und souveränem Auftreten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Deine Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse sind verhandlungssicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;#motivierend #lösungsorientiert #kommunikativ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2119&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;Freelance Principal Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt; to join Typeform on an initial, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2172&quot; data-end=&quot;2232&quot;&gt;full-time engagement&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you’ll operate as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2269&quot; data-end=&quot;2310&quot;&gt;full-cycle Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt;, owning hiring end-to-end across a mix of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2385&quot;&gt;technical and business roles&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;You’ll work in a small, high-ownership TA team, where the focus is not just on delivery—but on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2483&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;consistently raising the bar on talent and hiring quality&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Things you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ggdbeu&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;Own and drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2587&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;8–12 active roles simultaneously&lt;/strong&gt; across both technical, commercial and business functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7y4bcy&quot; data-start=&quot;2666&quot; data-end=&quot;2773&quot;&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2687&quot; data-end=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;high-quality candidate pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong focus on sourcing passive talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cfohpj&quot; data-start=&quot;2774&quot; data-end=&quot;2878&quot;&gt;Partner closely with hiring managers to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2816&quot; data-end=&quot;2876&quot;&gt;define role scope, success criteria, and hiring strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ll8d7j&quot; data-start=&quot;2879&quot; data-end=&quot;2994&quot;&gt;Run structured hiring processes from intake through to offer, ensuring &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2952&quot; data-end=&quot;2992&quot;&gt;clarity and alignment at every stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kv9lve&quot; data-start=&quot;2995&quot; data-end=&quot;3096&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3003&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;proactive communication&lt;/strong&gt; with stakeholders, anticipating needs and keeping momentum high&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16yg60k&quot; data-start=&quot;3097&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;Deliver a strong candidate experience while maintaining a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3157&quot; data-end=&quot;3191&quot;&gt;high and consistent hiring bar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ooze9z&quot; data-start=&quot;3194&quot; data-end=&quot;3262&quot;&gt;Close candidates by building trust, alignment, and long-term fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you already bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;autbs&quot; data-start=&quot;3296&quot; data-end=&quot;3379&quot;&gt;Proven experience as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3377&quot;&gt;full-cycle recruiter in a global SaaS or technology company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1byoaiw&quot; data-start=&quot;3380&quot; data-end=&quot;3447&quot;&gt;Comfortable hiring across both &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3413&quot; data-end=&quot;3445&quot;&gt;technical and business roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;grnn3c&quot; data-start=&quot;3448&quot; data-end=&quot;3547&quot;&gt;Strong sourcing capability—you know how to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3493&quot; data-end=&quot;3545&quot;&gt;identify, engage, and convert passive candidates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jjeudl&quot; data-start=&quot;3548&quot; data-end=&quot;3636&quot;&gt;Confidence in assessing talent and contributing to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3601&quot; data-end=&quot;3634&quot;&gt;high-quality hiring decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qnslg1&quot; data-start=&quot;3637&quot; data-end=&quot;3717&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management—you bring &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3679&quot; data-end=&quot;3715&quot;&gt;structure, clarity, and momentum&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tce487&quot; data-start=&quot;3718&quot; data-end=&quot;3805&quot;&gt;High ownership and autonomy—you’re comfortable operating at speed with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3782&quot; data-end=&quot;3803&quot;&gt;limited direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mo9tzs&quot; data-start=&quot;3806&quot; data-end=&quot;3883&quot;&gt;Ability to thrive in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3829&quot; data-end=&quot;3881&quot;&gt;fast-moving and sometimes ambiguous environments&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Talent Acquisition team at Celonis is a global function at the heart of our growth. We go beyond recruiting to act as trusted talent advisors and candidate experience champions, driving strategies that bring future leaders into the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for an experienced&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with a background hiring technical customer facing roles for a technology company.&amp;nbsp; This position offers the chance to directly influence our success, in a fast-scaling, international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a trusted partner to our Customer organizations, you will be responsible for overseeing and guiding both hiring managers and candidates through the full life-cycle recruitment process.You will be a strategic advisor to our leaders, bringing not only recruiting expertise but also actionable&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;talent insights&lt;/strong&gt; that influence hiring decisions and shape our overall talent strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the trusted partner to our hiring leaders and the main point of contact for our candidates throughout the recruitment journey. Leveraging your background in hiring top technical talent&amp;nbsp;you will bring credibility and market expertise to every search.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the market leader in &lt;strong&gt;Process Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;, and our TA team embraces this innovation daily. With our technology embedded in our ATS, you’ll have access to &lt;strong&gt;real-time data and advanced reporting tools&lt;/strong&gt; that sharpen your ability to advise, plan, and execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our regional hiring managers to understand their hiring needs and job requirements, offering strategic advice and support throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the HR team and Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits team and other internal stakeholders to align recruitment efforts with company goals and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the entire recruitment lifecycle, including sourcing, screening, interviewing, and extending offers to candidates for Enterprise Architects, Solution Architects, Services, PreSales and Value Engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute effective sourcing strategies to attract top talent, utilizing various channels such as job boards, social media, networking events, and referrals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a positive candidate experience throughout the recruitment process by providing timely feedback and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with Talent Coordination to schedule interviews, providing necessary support and resources to both candidates and hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Research &amp;amp; Talent Insights:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with industry trends, competitor activity, and market conditions to effectively position Celonis as an employer of choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market intelligence and insights to hiring managers to aid in decision-making and strategy development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process Excellence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze recruitment metrics to measure the effectiveness of recruiting strategies and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular updates and reports to management on recruitment activities, challenges, and successes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage our ATS and Sourcing Tools to ensure excellence and efficiencies are adopted in our working practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background recruiting technical customer facing roles, exceptional communication skills, and a passion for finding and hiring the best talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of technology and industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End to end recruitment experience from Sourcing to Offer Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inhouse, agency or RPO recruitment experience hiring for Product , Technology or IT Services businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in applicant tracking systems (ATS) and other recruitment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and interest in interacting with colleagues, candidates and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can come as you are – the fun-loving, passionate seller, who never gets shy of pushing boundaries or asking the tough questions with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously and prioritize workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sourcing and candidate outreach capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, design has to scale across a complex, enterprise-grade process intelligence platform, and increasingly, it has to scale to machines as well as people. AI coding agents now generate a growing share of the UI our engineers ship, and our design system is the contract that keeps that output on-brand, accessible, and consistent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of design, engineering, and product, with a strong emphasis on craft, usability, and scalability. You&#39;ll design and build the system itself, owning interaction decisions and front-end architecture, and translating complex process data and AI-driven behaviors into intuitive, high-performance experiences. It&#39;s a senior role: you&#39;ll often operate with minimal design oversight, set standards, lead initiatives, and mentor others while staying deeply hands-on in both design and code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the team that owns Celonis&#39;s design system and the operations behind how design gets done. We sit at the intersection of design and engineering, and we treat the system as a living product with real users, internal designers, product engineers, and the AI agents that now consume it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build production components in Angular and TypeScript, our design system is built in Angular and we may adopt React over time, on a foundation of rock-solid HTML and CSS (semantic markup, ARIA, and modern CSS custom properties driving design tokens).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own interaction decisions, component design, and front-end architecture end-to-end, independently translating ambiguous requirements into thoughtful, usable UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex process-intelligence data and AI-driven behaviors into clear, intuitive, high-performance operator experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical and craft standard for front-end quality, polish, motion and animation, performance, and accessibility, across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive rapid prototyping to explore novel interaction concepts and turn ambitious design visions into distinctive, testable experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with designers, PMs, and engineers to derive and evolve the design system through a healthy contribution model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the system agent-ready: maintain tokens-as-code in the W3C DTCG format (Style Dictionary or similar) and structure component metadata, docs, and APIs so AI coding agents can consume them as reliable context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and maintain Figma Code Connect mappings so Figma components link cleanly to their coded counterparts for engineers and agents alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evals as guardrails, visual-regression, accessibility, and token-compliance checks in CI, so generated and contributed UI meets the bar before it ships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tooling daily (Figma Make, v0, Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot, or similar), applying senior design and engineering judgment to critique and correct the output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system initiatives and mentor designers and engineers contributing to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 5–8 years across design engineering / UX engineering / front-end, including significant hands-on work building a design system or component library in a SaaS or B2B environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent UX instincts with strong attention to interaction detail and usability, you can own design decisions independently, with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong production front-end skills in Angular and TypeScript with rock-solid HTML and CSS fundamentals; experience with (or genuine openness to) React is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of design token architecture (primitive → semantic → component tiers) and modern token pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Figma fluency and comfort moving fluidly between design and code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated accessibility expertise (WCAG 2.2) implemented in code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on fluency with AI design and coding tools, and an opinionated, responsible point of view on using them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong product mindset and bias toward ownership, plus the communication and leadership of a senior IC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Figma Code Connect in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers e.g. the Figma Dev Mode MCP server or a custom design-system MCP server.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building evals for AI-generated UI, or writing specs/prompts for AI generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working on complex, data-dense, or real-time interfaces (a strong fit for our process-intelligence product).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Token-pipeline experience with Style Dictionary, Tokens Studio, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior role: you&#39;ll own major areas of the system with full autonomy, design and ship with a high bar for craft, set the standards others build to, lead initiatives, and mentor. We pair design craft with engineering depth and high curiosity about AI, building a system that&#39;s faster and safer for humans and agents alike.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa’s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience - one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like Booking.com, HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Sr Agent Architect&lt;/strong&gt; at Parloa, you will act as a solution architect for enterprise AI Agent deployments. You will design end-to-end system architectures that connect Parloa&#39;s platform to complex enterprise environments, solve multi-system integration challenges, and apply systems thinking to build reliable, scalable AI solutions for global enterprise clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also shape the conversational experience layer, using prompt engineering and your knowledge of LLMs to translate customer requirements into agent behavior. Architecture and integration depth are the core of this role. Conversational design skills are valued and can be developed on the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solution architectures for AI Agent deployments, mapping how Parloa&#39;s platform integrates into customers&#39; enterprise systems (CRMs, ERPs, ticketing systems, contact center platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and configure integrations using integration platforms and APIs, applying systems thinking to solve complex, multi-system data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Forward Deployed Engineers on complex or custom integration scenarios that go beyond standard integration capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply structured testing approaches to validate architecture, integration reliability, and AI agent performance under real-world conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve blockers together with other departments at Parloa (e.g., Product, Solution Engineering, Sales) and the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope AI Agent deployments, providing strategic architecture advice and execution support to customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your knowledge of LLM internals (e.g., embeddings) to analyze customer requirements and design prompts for reliable, user-aligned agent behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex customer workflows into structured conversational components that LLMs can execute reliably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fine-tune conversational flows and voice output (e.g., SSML, Lexicons, Regex) to align with customer brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document best practices, how-to guides, and product capabilities for internal and external audiences, representing the expertise of the Agent Architect team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in enterprise customer-facing roles, with proven expertise in solution architecture, systems architecture, or enterprise integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, with a track record of solving complex technical problems across multiple systems and data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with complex SaaS implementations at scale (CRMs, ERPs, contact center platforms, ticketing systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in REST API design, JSON/XML data structures, API testing tools (e.g., Postman), and API authentication patterns (OAuth, API keys, JWT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reading and consuming API documentation across enterprise SaaS platforms, including data transformation and field mapping logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and critical thinker with expertise in risk assessment and problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project and stakeholder management skills, with a passion for meeting milestones and effective communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with initiative, results orientation, and ability to identify opportunities for impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze customer requirements and translate them into LLM prompts and conversational flows, with attention to subtle conversational nuance and A/B testing to assess agent performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior conversation design, prompt engineering (e.g., chain-of-thought, few-shot learning), or A/B testing experience is a plus, not a requirement - we will train this.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English is required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Recruiting Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition → Hiring Manager → Technical Interview(s) → Bar Raiser&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Why Parloa?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;re at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn&#39;t just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We&#39;re building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren&#39;t just support tickets; they&#39;re defining experiences. We&#39;re here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments, this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Parloa, ownership isn&#39;t a buzzword; it means being accountable for outcomes, not just tasks. We operate in a category that&#39;s evolving fast, where the bar is high, and the problems are complex. We hire people who think in solutions, communicate with clarity, and follow through. People who are comfortable making decisions, taking responsibility, and raising the standard for themselves and those around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve grown beyond the earliest startup phase, but we&#39;ve kept the intensity: fast execution, direct feedback, and a strong expectation to contribute meaningfully from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Backed by leading global investors like General Catalyst, EQT Ventures, and Altimeter Capital, we&#39;re scaling with a clear ambition: to become the global category leader in enterprise-grade conversational AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/P4d-iyx7RQM&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is committed to upholding the highest data protection standards for our clients&#39; and employees&#39; data. All our employees are instrumental in ensuring the utmost care, GDPR, and ISO compliance, including ISO 27001, in handling sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is an e-verify employer in the USA. &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Please click here to learn more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;* &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We provide equal opportunities to all qualified applicants regardless race, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, national origin, disability status, socioeconomic background and other characteristics.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We seek an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Senior Go Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Workato Genie team. In this role, you will be responsible for developing mission-critical features and services for the Workato platform, including AI chatbot dispatching and balancing synchronous and asynchronous AI execution. In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build high-performance gateways and routing components&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build server-side infrastructure for logging and monitoring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Infra and SRE teams to ensure high availability and scalability requirements are addressed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with the AI team to design and implement innovative features for a new AI assistant, ensuring cutting-edge performance and user experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute at all phases of the development lifecycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write well-designed, testable, efficient code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate and propose improvements to the existing system&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support continuous improvement by investigating alternatives and technologies and presenting these for architectural review&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BS/MS degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related subject&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
