&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, proven experience in analytics engineering or data engineering, with a track record of building and maintaining production data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level SQL skills for complex transformations and query optimisation, with hands-on experience building layered data models in a modern data warehouse or lakehouse (e.g. Snowflake, Iceberg) and solid command of dbt, including testing, documentation, and modelling conventions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think in terms of business domains, not just tables, translating complex business logic into clean, durable, and reusable data models across entities, events, states, and rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across squads with Product Managers, Engineers, Analysts, and Data Scientists, contributing to data design conversations and helping teams treat data as a first-class deliverable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep care for data quality, trust, and discoverability, building models others can rely on, with a proactive mindset around contracts, freshness, observability, and failure scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
